<title>USA: Morgan Keegan wins Knox County, Tenn., $70 mln GOs.</title>
<headline>Morgan Keegan wins Knox County, Tenn., $70 mln GOs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan said Wednesday it won $70 million of Knox County, Tenn., general obligation public improvement bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.24 percent.</p>
